{"id":"acac1315890d72f8","group":"58","path":"58/batch20/58-df-zfc-measure2-integral-simple-function.md","title":"ZFC Measure2 Integral Simple Function","display":"df-zfc-measure2-integral-simple-function — ZFC Measure2 Integral Simple Function","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-measure2-integral-simple-function","aliases":["58-df-zfc-measure2-integral-simple-function"],"display":"df-zfc-measure2-integral-simple-function — ZFC Measure2 Integral Simple Function","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[58-df-function]]","[[58-df-integral]]","[[58-df-measure]]","[[58-df-measure-space]]","[[58-df-zfc-measure10-simple-function-code]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-measure2-integral-simple-function"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-measure2-integral-simple-function</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-measure2-integral-simple-function — ZFC Measure2 Integral Simple Function"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"58-df-function\">58-df-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"4884f45058a56aac\" href=\"?note=4884f45058a56aac\" title=\"58-df-integral\">58-df-integral</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"ca832ed6bc22f728\" href=\"?note=ca832ed6bc22f728\" title=\"58-df-measure\">58-df-measure</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"83a15c7e9b3817dc\" href=\"?note=83a15c7e9b3817dc\" title=\"58-df-measure-space\">58-df-measure-space</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"1170b259facfb323\" href=\"?note=1170b259facfb323\" title=\"58-df-zfc-measure10-simple-function-code\">58-df-zfc-measure10-simple-function-code</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\in V\">\\(X\\in V\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma\\subseteq\\mathcal P(X)\">\\(\\Sigma\\subseteq\\mathcal P(X)\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mu\">\\(\\mu\\)</span> (measure-space data)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s=\\langle A,c\\rangle\">\\(s=\\langle A,c\\rangle\\)</span> (simple-function code)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I\\in[0,\\infty]\">\\(I\\in[0,\\infty]\\)</span> (integral value)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\omega\">\\(n\\in\\omega\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,c\\in V\">\\(A,c\\in V\\)</span> (code witnesses)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i\\in n\">\\(i\\in n\\)</span> (finite index)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MeasureSpace}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{MeasureSpace}_S\\)</span> (measure-space predicate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}\\)</span> (function-graph predicate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure10SimpleFunctionCode}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure10SimpleFunctionCode}_S\\)</span> (simple-code predicate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure2IntegralSimpleFunction}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure2IntegralSimpleFunction}_S\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}measure2\\text{-}integral\\text{-}simple\\text{-}function} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcMeasure2IntegralSimpleFunction}_S(I,s,X,\\Sigma,\\mu)\\leftrightarrow I\\in[0,\\infty]\\land\\mathrm{MeasureSpace}_S(X,\\Sigma,\\mu)\\land\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure10SimpleFunctionCode}_S(s,X,\\Sigma)\\land\\exists n\\in\\omega\\;\\exists A,c\\in V\\;\\Bigl[\\mathrm{Function}(A,n,\\Sigma)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(c,n,\\mathbb R)\\land\\operatorname{ran}(c)\\subseteq\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}\\land s=\\langle A,c\\rangle\\land I=\\sum_{i\\in n}c(i)\\mu(A(i))\\Bigr]\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}measure2\\text{-}integral\\text{-}simple\\text{-}function} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcMeasure2IntegralSimpleFunction}_S(I,s,X,\\Sigma,\\mu)\\leftrightarrow I\\in[0,\\infty]\\land\\mathrm{MeasureSpace}_S(X,\\Sigma,\\mu)\\land\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure10SimpleFunctionCode}_S(s,X,\\Sigma)\\land\\exists n\\in\\omega\\;\\exists A,c\\in V\\;\\Bigl[\\mathrm{Function}(A,n,\\Sigma)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(c,n,\\mathbb R)\\land\\operatorname{ran}(c)\\subseteq\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}\\land s=\\langle A,c\\rangle\\land I=\\sum_{i\\in n}c(i)\\mu(A(i))\\Bigr]\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>This is the nonnegative simple-function integral, so the finite extended-real sum cannot contain the undefined form <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"+\\infty-\\infty\">\\(+\\infty-\\infty\\)</span>; as usual, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0\\cdot\\infty=0\">\\(0\\cdot\\infty=0\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-function","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-fu